  "id": "ecs",
  "term": "ECS",
  "definition": "ECS stands for Embodied Cognition Scale, a measure developed to assess embodied cognition in Chinese university students. It is intended to reflect the idea that thinking is shaped by bodily movement, perception, and interaction with the environment, while also incorporating culturally relevant body–mind unity.",
